{
  "name": "StreamVault: post Shorts",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## StreamVault: post the next Short\n\nRuns every 4 hours. Looks at every folder in **OneDrive/StreamVault/ready/**, skips Shorts on hold, and picks the highest priority (set in the StreamVault app), then the best score, then the oldest. Uploads its video.mp4 to YouTube with the title, description and tags from post.json, writes result.json next to it and moves the folder to **posted/**.\n\nNothing waiting = nothing happens. A failed upload leaves the Short in ready/ for next time.\n\n**Change how often:** open *Every 4 hours* and edit the cron (minute hour …).\n**Privacy, category, language:** top of *Build upload*.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 380
      },
      "id": "899b9507-c1d4-53d2-859c-3089703d78cd",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -220,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 */4 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "4e815419-6de1-5cb9-b023-9c7839d493b7",
      "name": "Every 4 hours",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "d2b850c3-77de-56ee-824e-ad7bd00af99d",
      "name": "Test now",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/me/drive/root:/StreamVault/ready:/children?$top=200",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "microsoftOneDriveOAuth2Api",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "44225b2a-eabb-53fc-95ca-b06e87837d96",
      "name": "List ready",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Every folder waiting in ready/. Which one posts is decided in Build upload, from post.json.\nconst kids = $input.first().json.value ?? [];\nreturn kids\n  .filter(k => k.folder && !/^[._]/.test(k.name))\n  .slice(0, 200)\n  .map(k => ({ json: { folderId: k.id, folderName: k.name } }));\n"
      },
      "id": "bd8145eb-66e3-5f37-8915-aa7296deeb2c",
      "name": "Pick candidates",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "=https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/me/drive/items/{{ $json.folderId }}/children",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "microsoftOneDriveOAuth2Api",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e916a231-ef48-521f-946c-59bb5e66493d",
      "name": "List files",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        680,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Keep folders that have post.json (the PC writes it last) and video.mp4. A result.json means the\n// Short was already uploaded but the move to posted/ failed: never upload it twice.\nconst out = [];\n$input.all().forEach((item, i) => {\n  const files = {};\n  for (const f of item.json.value ?? []) if (f.file) files[f.name] = f;\n  if (files['result.json'] || !files['post.json'] || !files['video.mp4']) return;\n  out.push({ json: {\n    ...$('Pick candidates').itemMatching(i).json,\n    postUrl: files['post.json']['@microsoft.graph.downloadUrl'],\n    videoUrl: files['video.mp4']['@microsoft.graph.downloadUrl'],\n    videoBytes: files['video.mp4'].size,\n  } });\n});\nreturn out;\n"
      },
      "id": "abbe3d01-0873-5f8a-b847-6abfc3273c8e",
      "name": "Choose post",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        900,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $json.postUrl }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "7559b79a-f448-5700-bffb-b0260c48a33f",
      "name": "Get post.json",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Settings\nconst PRIVACY = 'public';      // 'private' or 'unlisted' to post without going live\nconst CATEGORY_ID = '24';      // Entertainment\nconst LANGUAGE = 'en';\nconst PRIORITY_RANK = { high: 0, normal: 1, low: 2 };\n\n// Rank what's waiting: priority (set in the StreamVault app), then score, then oldest.\n// Skip Shorts on hold, and ones whose video is still syncing (smaller than the PC recorded).\nconst candidates = $input.all()\n  .map((item, i) => ({ pick: $('Choose post').itemMatching(i).json, post: item.json }))\n  .filter(({ pick, post }) => !post.hold && !(post.video_bytes && post.video_bytes !== pick.videoBytes))\n  .sort((a, b) =>\n    (PRIORITY_RANK[a.post.priority] ?? 1) - (PRIORITY_RANK[b.post.priority] ?? 1)\n    || (b.post.score ?? 0) - (a.post.score ?? 0)\n    || String(a.post.exported_at ?? a.pick.folderName).localeCompare(String(b.post.exported_at ?? b.pick.folderName)));\nif (!candidates.length) return [];\nconst { pick, post } = candidates[0];\n\n// YouTube rejects < and > in titles and descriptions.\nconst clean = (s, n) => {\n  s = String(s ?? '').replace(/</g, '‹').replace(/>/g, '›').trim();\n  return s.length <= n ? s : s.slice(0, n - 1).trimEnd() + '…';\n};\nconst bytes = s => new TextEncoder().encode(s).length;\nlet description = clean(post.description, 5000);\nwhile (bytes(description) > 5000) description = description.slice(0, -50);\nconst tags = [];\nfor (const t of post.tags ?? []) {\n  const v = String(t).replace(/^#/, '').trim();\n  if (v && !tags.includes(v) && [...tags, v].join(',').length <= 480) tags.push(v);\n}\nconst title = clean(post.title, 100);\nconst lang = post.language ?? LANGUAGE;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  ...pick,\n  title,\n  priority: post.priority ?? 'normal',\n  score: post.score ?? null,\n  waiting: candidates.length,\n  request: {\n    snippet: { title, description, tags, categoryId: String(post.category_id ?? CATEGORY_ID),\n               defaultLanguage: lang, defaultAudioLanguage: lang },\n    status: { privacyStatus: PRIVACY, selfDeclaredMadeForKids: false, containsSyntheticMedia: false },\n  },\n} }];\n"
      },
      "id": "31a811f9-f5e2-5788-9b0d-d7f876dc9de5",
      "name": "Build upload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://www.googleapis.com/upload/youtube/v3/videos?uploadType=resumable&part=snippet,status",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "youTubeOAuth2Api",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-Upload-Content-Type",
              "value": "video/mp4"
            },
            {
              "name": "X-Upload-Content-Length",
              "value": "={{ $json.videoBytes }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.request) }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "4ab4f95e-7a73-5e43-9974-a2276ea3ed39",
      "name": "Start YouTube upload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1560,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $('Build upload').first().json.videoUrl }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file"
            }
          },
          "timeout": 600000
        }
      },
      "id": "8cdbb438-95af-5bae-a1d1-bad9beff66e4",
      "name": "Download video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1780,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "={{ $('Start YouTube upload').first().json.headers.location }}",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "youTubeOAuth2Api",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "video/mp4"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "binaryData",
        "inputDataFieldName": "data",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 1800000
        }
      },
      "id": "1025e989-295f-5d8f-8651-1c6a1e893cd9",
      "name": "Upload video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        2000,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "=https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/me/drive/items/{{ $('Build upload').first().json.folderId }}:/result.json:/content",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "microsoftOneDriveOAuth2Api",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ video_id: $json.id, url: 'https://youtube.com/shorts/' + $json.id, title: $('Build upload').first().json.title, privacy: $json.status?.privacyStatus, upload_status: $json.status?.uploadStatus, posted_at: $now.toISO() }, null, 2) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7731cf65-2763-56ed-a116-9ed189471656",
      "name": "Save result.json",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        2220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/me/drive/root:/StreamVault/posted",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "microsoftOneDriveOAuth2Api",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f80b62fe-e946-56e0-86e9-2d2af0fc9aac",
      "name": "Find posted folder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        2440,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "=https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/me/drive/items/{{ $('Build upload').first().json.folderId }}",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "microsoftOneDriveOAuth2Api",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ parentReference: { id: $json.id } }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6101188d-42d0-5312-a9a4-154760255098",
      "name": "Move to posted",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        2660,
        300
      ]
    }
  ],
